{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your world is dying. After extreme weather has caused a powerful storm to destroy your home, you are now in search for one of the famous sanctuaries, a safe haven for all birds away from the rain. Follow Puddles in her journey through the dangerous forest before any predators find her and unravel a mysterious world now destroyed. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock abilities to easier traverse the world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maneuver dangerous obstacles and try to avoid certain death</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the world and make your way to safety</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SKYLIGHT INTERACTIVE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Rainbound&quot; is an atmospheric 2D platformer  by Skylight Interactive</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3592410?t=1757960793","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3592410?t=1757960793","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592410/b9807d43389ad90dea82c91c6171eb30af04b7ad/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757960793","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592410/b9807d43389ad90dea82c91c6171eb30af04b7ad/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757960793","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3990410,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your world is dying. After extreme weather has caused a powerful storm to destroy your home, you are now in search for one of the famous sanctuaries, a safe haven for all birds away from the rain. Follow Puddles in her journey through the dangerous forest before any predators find her and unravel a mysterious world now destroyed. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag